These two programs come unchanged from the Morris worm example in the
SEED-Emulator repository (https://github.com/seed-labs/seed-emulator):

    examples/yesterday_once_more/Y02_morris_worm/emulator/container_files/

  server   server.c, 64-bit: accepts connections on port 9090 and feeds
           each one to `stack`
  stack    stack.c, 32-bit and static, built with
           `gcc -DBUF_SIZE=100 -DSHOW_FP -z execstack -fno-stack-protector -static -m32`

The sources and the Makefile are copied next to this file under src/.
To rebuild them: `cd src && make && cp server stack ../`.
